# Keep the build context small, and keep secrets out of the image.
#
# data/ is the important one: it holds the Ed25519 marketplace signing key and
# the database. If it were sent as build context it could be baked into a layer,
# which would leak the marketplace identity to anyone who can pull the image.
# The image creates its own empty /data; the real one is a mounted volume.
.git
.gitignore
.superpowers
bin
data
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.key
docs
*.md
